{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22004","headline":"秦中吟十首 买花 · 白居易","name":"秦中吟十首 买花","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"帝城春欲暮，喧喧车马度。\n共道牡丹时，相随买花去。\n贵贱无常价，酬直看花数。\n灼灼百朵红，戋戋五束素。\n上张幄幕庇，旁织巴篱护。\n水洒复泥封，移来色如故。\n家家习爲俗，人人迷不悟。\n有一田舍翁，偶来买花处。\n低头独长叹，此叹无人喻。\n一丛深色花，十户中人赋。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_22004.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22004","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry、《全唐诗》（清·曹寅等编，康熙扬州诗局本）","citation":"殷志佳"}